ackground is mostly dark with a gradient of light gray, focusing attention on the character. The texture of the painting is smooth, with soft brushstrokes that emphasize the light and shadow. The overall composition and use of light create a sense of depth and three-dimensionality. The style is reminiscent of gothic or dark fantasy art, with an emphasis on contrast and dramatic lighting to create a haunting, almost supernatural effect."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 9, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.3"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [432.69403076171875, 727.8896484375], "pos": [-1172.886474609375, -275.8843078613281], "widgets_values": ["电影级CG模型生图"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 34, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 26, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [1], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [260, 110], "pos": [-2343.814208984375, -306.53076171875], "widgets_values": ["YY CG超质感Z-Image_turbo_bf16-v3.0.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name